---
description: >-
  Edge labels as tags inside a coloured system boundary (D628): the label
  inside the boundary keeps the theme background as its fill, as the label
  outside does.
config:
  theme: redux-color
---
usecase-beta
  direction LR
  actor Customer
  systemBoundary shop["Shop"]
    Browse
    Checkout
  end
  Customer -- "outside" ---> Browse
  Browse -- "inside" ---> Checkout
